WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:14.107
stared at Mog in disbelief.

2
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.109
Mog wanted to sneak back into People Place?

3
00:00:17.129 --> 00:00:20.492
"Let me finish," said Mog.

4
00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:26.537
"I think we should sneak into People Place, go to Mayor Hubbletree's house, and apologize."

5
00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:29.540
"What?" Ben's jaw dropped.

6
00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:31.837
He had imagined telling Mr.

7
00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:33.057
Freaky what had happened.

8
00:00:34.598 --> 00:00:37.239
But he'd never imagined speaking directly to the mayor!

9
00:00:37.259 --> 00:00:42.541
"It's the right thing to do," Mog went on.

10
00:00:42.561 --> 00:00:44.642
"I'll tell him the truth.

11
00:00:45.042 --> 00:00:46.723
And I'll explain that I tricked you."

12
00:00:48.744 --> 00:00:52.945
Just then Winnie stepped out from the crowd, her eyes flashing with anger.

13
00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:55.826
"I heard that, Mog!

14
00:00:56.407 --> 00:00:59.228
It's your fault Monster Academy is going to be destroyed!"

15
00:01:01.028 --> 00:01:01.869
Mog gulped.

16
00:01:02.909 --> 00:01:07.272
"I—I didn't mean to—" "We're through!"

17
00:01:07.793 --> 00:01:08.353
said Winnie.

18
00:01:08.373 --> 00:01:12.576
"Even if the school was still having the dance, I wouldn't go with you.

19
00:01:13.517 --> 00:01:15.978
Not if you were the last monster in Monsterville!"

20
00:01:17.239 --> 00:01:18.940
She spun around and walked away.

21
00:01:20.181 --> 00:01:21.862
Mog stared after her and sighed.

22
00:01:21.882 --> 00:01:26.545
"We'd better do something fast," he murmured.

23
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:34.223
That evening Ben and Mog met by the fence between Monsterville and People Place.

24
00:01:39.646 --> 00:01:43.048
Mog couldn't fly, so Ben waited while he climbed the fence.

25
00:01:44.589 --> 00:01:46.751
Halfway over, Mog let out a yelp.

26
00:01:47.191 --> 00:01:49.913
"Uh-oh," said Mog.

27
00:01:49.933 --> 00:01:51.354
"I'm stuck!"

28
00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:53.656
"How are you stuck?"

29
00:01:54.176 --> 00:01:54.736
said Ben.

30
00:01:54.756 --> 00:01:58.539
"My pants are caught on a nail," said Mog.

31
00:01:59.239 --> 00:02:00.080
"Hold on a second."

32
00:02:01.388 --> 00:02:04.970
The monster tried to lift himself to free his pants, but he slipped.

33
00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:10.412
Rip! Ben tried not to laugh as Mog hung from the nail by his ripped pants.

34
00:02:11.832 --> 00:02:14.093
"Ugh!" cried Mog.

35
00:02:14.113 --> 00:02:16.894
"This is—" Rip!

36
00:02:17.355 --> 00:02:20.556
Mog's pants ripped some more, and then he fell to the ground.

37
00:02:20.576 --> 00:02:24.218
"Ouch!" "Are you okay?"

38
00:02:24.758 --> 00:02:25.378
asked Ben.

39
00:02:26.618 --> 00:02:27.579
Mog rubbed his head.

40
00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:29.940
"Yeah, I'm okay."

41
00:02:31.392 --> 00:02:33.533
He stood up, and his pants fell down.

42
00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:36.375
"Aw, man!

43
00:02:36.815 --> 00:02:38.436
My pants are ruined!"

44
00:02:38.456 --> 00:02:42.799
"Never mind that now," said Ben.

45
00:02:42.819 --> 00:02:44.880
"Let's just get this over with."

46
00:02:46.021 --> 00:02:48.162
Ben and Mog hurried toward the mayor's house.

47
00:02:49.123 --> 00:02:51.164
Mog had to hold up his pants as he ran.

48
00:02:53.346 --> 00:02:56.728
The sun was setting, and the streetlights were beginning to flicker on.

49
00:02:59.192 --> 00:03:02.235
Soon Ben and Mog were standing in front of the mayor's house.

50
00:03:02.255 --> 00:03:04.457
"What do we do now?"

51
00:03:05.077 --> 00:03:05.638
asked Ben.

52
00:03:05.658 --> 00:03:09.661
"We go up to the door and knock," said Mog.

53
00:03:10.842 --> 00:03:11.663
Ben gulped.

54
00:03:11.683 --> 00:03:14.565
"You first," he said.

55
00:03:15.886 --> 00:03:19.009
They went to the door, and Mog knocked with one hand.

56
00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.291
The other hand was still holding up his pants.

57
00:03:23.432 --> 00:03:27.135
Ben's heart beat faster as he heard heavy footsteps getting closer.

58
00:03:28.544 --> 00:03:32.287
The door finally opened, and Mayor Hubbletree was standing there.

59
00:03:32.307 --> 00:03:36.130
"Monsters!" cried the mayor.

60
00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.552
"What are you doing here?"

61
00:03:38.572 --> 00:03:42.155
"Hello, s-sir," Ben stammered.

62
00:03:42.175 --> 00:03:45.998
"We, uh—" "Monsters?"

63
00:03:46.639 --> 00:03:47.940
cried a little boy's voice.

64
00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.563
Ben gulped as the mayor's son ran to the doorway.

65
00:03:51.583 --> 00:03:53.584
"Oh no!"

66
00:03:54.085 --> 00:03:54.685
thought Ben.

67
00:03:54.705 --> 00:03:57.688
"He'll see us and get scared all over again!"

68
00:03:58.728 --> 00:03:59.608
It was too late.

69
00:04:00.308 --> 00:04:04.330
The boy stood in the doorway and stared, wide-eyed, at Mog and Ben.

70
00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.210
He looked like he was going to scream.

71
00:04:08.611 --> 00:04:11.992
Mog held up his hands and said, "Don't be scared!"

72
00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:15.012
Instantly his pants fell down.

73
00:04:21.734 --> 00:04:23.335
The boy laughed hysterically.

74
00:04:24.515 --> 00:04:27.636
Mog's face turned red as he quickly pulled his pants back up.

75
00:04:28.576 --> 00:04:32.598
"Sorry about that, I—" "That's funny!"

76
00:04:33.238 --> 00:04:33.898
said the boy.

77
00:04:33.918 --> 00:04:38.680
"Ha-ha!" Mayor Hubbletree had been frowning.

78
00:04:39.801 --> 00:04:42.662
But as he watched his son laugh, his frown faded.

79
00:04:44.002 --> 00:04:45.163
Soon he was smiling.

80
00:04:46.063 --> 00:04:47.504
Then he was laughing.

81
00:04:50.905 --> 00:04:53.626
Ben looked from the boy to the mayor to Mog.

82
00:04:54.487 --> 00:04:56.928
Despite being embarrassed, Mog grinned.

83
00:04:57.740 --> 00:05:01.082
"Ha-ha!" Then Ben laughed too.

84
00:05:09.226 --> 00:05:13.429
The next day at school, Ben heard lots of kids talking about him and Mog.

85
00:05:13.449 --> 00:05:20.833
"I heard Mog and Ben went to Mayor Hubbletree's house last night," said a ghoul.

86
00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:23.714
"Yeah," said a troll.

87
00:05:23.734 --> 00:05:26.816
"I heard Mog's pants fell down."

88
00:05:28.148 --> 00:05:31.992
"It's a good thing they did," said a purple monster.

89
00:05:32.012 --> 00:05:35.134
"The mayor's son thought it was funny.

90
00:05:35.595 --> 00:05:38.097
The mayor isn't angry at monsters anymore."

91
00:05:38.957 --> 00:05:39.898
A mummy nodded.

92
00:05:39.918 --> 00:05:45.082
"Yep. And now he's no longer planning on destroying Monster Academy."

93
00:05:46.203 --> 00:05:51.348
Ben also overheard that Mayor Hubbletree wasn't just going to leave Monster Academy alone.

94
00:05:51.368 --> 00:05:57.833
"I'd like to see monsters and people get along," the mayor had told Mr.

95
00:05:57.893 --> 00:06:02.577
Freaky. "Maybe our students could take a field trip to Monster Academy."

96
00:06:02.597 --> 00:06:06.520
"That would be wonderful," said Mr.

97
00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:11.004
Freaky. "And I'm sure our monsters would love to see People Place."

98
00:06:12.685 --> 00:06:17.349
Ben was floating along the school hallway as monsters gathered around to congratulate him.

99
00:06:17.369 --> 00:06:19.271
"Way to go, Ben!"

100
00:06:19.811 --> 00:06:20.592
shouted a ghoul.

101
00:06:20.612 --> 00:06:23.154
"Thanks," said Ben.

102
00:06:23.174 --> 00:06:27.697
"It was really Mog's—" Suddenly—crash!

103
00:06:28.377 --> 00:06:30.137
A broomstick smashed through a wall!

104
00:06:31.218 --> 00:06:33.158
Mr. Freaky rushed into the hallway.

105
00:06:33.819 --> 00:06:36.159
He moaned when he saw the broomstick in the wall.

106
00:06:36.179 --> 00:06:40.101
"Who is doing this?

107
00:06:40.341 --> 00:06:41.681
It has to stop!"

108
00:06:42.641 --> 00:06:43.602
Ben cringed.

109
00:06:44.382 --> 00:06:46.803
He knew now it wasn't Mog stealing the brooms.

110
00:06:47.863 --> 00:06:49.103
So there was only one other
